A biological safety cabinet is used for working with infectious bacterial agents.
生物安全柜用于处理具有传染性的细菌病原体。

27
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:38,950
The air flows through a HEPA filter to create a clean working environment, so it protects
空气流经 HEPA 过滤器，形成洁净的工作环境，所以它既保护

